# 100 Agents 2026 — Phase-by-Phase Roadmap

---

## Phase 1 — Foundations (Agents #01–10)

**Goal:** Understand core mechanics, input, validation, and basic state.

| Agent | Purpose                | Scope                                             |
| ----- | ---------------------- | ------------------------------------------------- |
| 01    | Prompt-only agent      | Normalize user input, test LLM prompting basics   |
| 02    | Simple Response agent  | Generate deterministic template responses         |
| 03    | Logging agent          | Record system events for debugging and reflection |
| 04    | Memory Setup agent     | Initialize memory structures for later use        |
| 05    | Memory Decision agent  | Determine if memory is required for input         |
| 06    | Validator agent        | Validate input and outputs for correctness        |
| 07    | Meta-Decision agent    | Handle simple decision routing between agents     |
| 08    | Tool Decision agent    | Decide if an external tool needs to be called     |
| 09    | Context Builder agent  | Aggregate input, memory, and outputs into context |
| 10    | Response Builder agent | Format outputs deterministically for user/system  |

---

