| 12    | Long-term Memory agent      | Interface with persistent storage, vector DB              |
| 13    | Reflection agent            | Analyze outputs and state to learn from errors            |
| 14    | Self-Critic agent           | Evaluate own outputs for quality and correctness          |
| 15    | Error-Correcting agent      | Flag issues and suggest corrections                       |
| 16–40 | Memory & Reasoning variants | Introduce advanced reasoning, retrieval, evaluation loops |

